{"id":"448267","name":"豆腐菌菇汤","author":"寻梦一ZbDu","authorId":"10886247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/448267/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"100克"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"半捆"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"小油菜","amount":"2棵"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"一段"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大豆腐100克，金针菇半捆，小油菜2棵，西红柿1个，大蒜适量，大葱1段。","img":"images/448267/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"油菜泡洗干净，掰成段。","img":"images/448267/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"金针菇切两刀，去根撕散。","img":"images/448267/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"开水烫一下过凉。","img":"images/448267/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐切条。","img":"images/448267/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开水烫一下去腥味。","img":"images/448267/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"西红柿去皮切块。","img":"images/448267/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"准备好所有食材，西红柿加一点糖。","img":"images/448267/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"平底锅加热炒香葱花蒜末。","img":"images/448267/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加番茄炒软。","img":"images/448267/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炝上汤。","img":"images/448267/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开锅加金针菇和豆腐。","img":"images/448267/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加盐和五香粉。","img":"images/448267/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加油菜，关火。","img":"images/448267/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"口味清淡，色泽美观，春季润燥好汤水。","img":"images/448267/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}